OL,3,AVote on Irish schools law set to fall
OL,4,Aafter Stormont veto
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt means the legislation will require
OL,7,Fcross-community support from a majority
OL,8,Fof both unionists and nationalists
OL,9,Fpoliticians in the Stormont assembly
OL,10,Fchamber in order for it to proceed.
